  "text": "Skip to content\nFully insured shipping\nAuthenticity guaranteed\nWe buy it back\nNYC Diamond District counter\nSecure checkout\n100 Gram Britannia Minted Gold Bar (In Assay)\nby\nThe Royal Mint\n✓ LBMA Good Delivery\n$\n13,816.90\nPriced live off the spot market.\nSee price history ↓\nMetal\nGold\nWeight\n100 gram Grams\nPurity\n99.99\nType\nBar\nOut of stock\nAdd to wishlist\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nFully insured shipping\nShips in 1–3 business days\nWe buy it back —\nsell to us\nSecure checkout · NYC Diamond District counter\nCategories:\nGold Bars\n,\n100 Gram Gold Bars\n,\nGram Gold Bars\nMint:\nThe Royal Mint\nPrice history\n100 Gram Britannia Minted Gold Bar (In Assay) was last recorded at $13,798.03 on October 9, 2026. Over the past 12 months it is down 0.8% and has ranged between $13,628.51 and $19,296.79.\nLast recorded\nLoading…\n1Y\n7D\n1M\n3M\n6M\n1Y\nAll\nDescription\nAdditional information\nDescription\nDescription\nBullion Trading LLC presents you with the opportunity to expand your portfolio and secure your holdings by investing in the stunning 100 Gram Gold Bar – The Royal Mint Britannia. This .9999 fine gold bar is sealed in an assay card with a unique serial number. It features Britannia, which tributes to Britain’s strength and integrity, conceived over 2000 years ago in the Roman occupation of Britain.\nDesign of 100 Gold Bar .9999 Fine- The Royal Mint Britannia (In Assay)\nThe stunning 100 Gram Britannia gold bar is produced by The Royal Mint and designed by Jody Clark, famous for his coin designs. Clark has presented the Britannia in a new design making it an attractive bar for collectors.\nThe observed design features the right profile of Britannia wearing a Corinthian helmet, holding her trident and shield, which has the Union Jack flag of Britain. The background of the bar features the design of waves to represent the marine history of Britain.\nThe reserve of the gold bar includes the waves and a prominent Royal Mint logo. The bottom of the bar includes a six-digital serial number that starts with “RM”, which stands for Royal Mint, and below it is the design of the sea waves.\nMain Highlights of 100 Gram Gold Bar .9999 Fine- The Royal Mint Britannia (In Assay)\nContains .9999 pure gold for 3.215 Troy oz’s\nEligible for Precious Metal IRAs\nEach bar is protected with a tamper-evident assay card stating the metal weight, individual serial, and purity.\nObserve the portrait of Britannia holding a trident and shield. The waves represent the marine history of Britannia.\nThe reserve features the wave design as well and has a prominent Royal Mint logo. It includes the weight, purity, and metal content of the bar.\nProduct Specifications:100 Gold Bar .9999 Fine- The Royal Mint Britannia (In Assay)\nSpecification\nDetails\nMint\nThe Royal Mint\nSeries\nBritannia Bar\nMetal Weight\n3.215 Troy Ounce’s\nPackaging Type\nAssay\nPurity\n.9999\nDimension\n55.15 mm x 32 mm x 3mm\nBuy 100 Gram Gold Bar .9999 Fine- The Royal Mint Britannia (In Assay)\nBullion Trading LLC brings you the best deal on the beautifully designed Royal Mint Britannia 100 Gram Gold Bar with .9999 finesse. Get yours while the stock last.\nYou can contact us at 646-362-3536, live chat, or email if you have any questions about this gold bar, and we’ll be glad to answer your queries.\nAdditional information\nMetal\nGold\nProduct Type\nbullion\nIssuer Country\nGB\nIs Legal Tender\nNo\nIs Monetized Bullion\nNo\nPurity %\n99.99\nType of Bullion\nBar\nWeight\n100 gram\nWeight Unit\nGrams\nRelated products\nQty\nAdd to cart\nGold Bars\n,\n1 oz Gold Bars\n,\nGifts\n,\nReligious Collection\n2013 PAMP Suisse White Snake 1 Oz Gold Bar  (In Assay)\n$\n4,401.42\nQty\nAdd to cart\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nQty\nAdd to cart\nGold Bars\n,\n10 Gram Gold Bars\n,\nGram Gold Bars\n10 Gram Gold Bar – PAMP Suisse Lady Fortuna (In Assay)\n$\n1,482.75\nQty\nAdd to cart\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nQty\nAdd to cart\nGold